---
import heroImage from '../../assets/photo_2.jpg';
---
<!DOCTYPE html>
<html lang="en">
<head>
<meta charset="utf-8">
<meta name="viewport" content="width=device-width, initial-scale=1">
<title>Net Zero Industrial Precincts &amp; Eco-Industrial Precinct Services | Circular Ecosystems</title>
<meta name="description" content="Strategic industrial circularity from regional strategy to precinct delivery. Net zero industrial precinct design, eco-industrial park development, industrial symbiosis programs, whole-of-system modelling, and supply chain studies, built on the Khora decision intelligence engine.">
<link rel="canonical" href="https://www.circularecosystems.io/services">
<link rel="icon" type="image/png" href="/logoofCE.png">
<link rel="apple-touch-icon" href="/logoofCE.png">

<!-- Open Graph -->
<meta property="og:title" content="Services | Circular Ecosystems">
<meta property="og:description" content="From regional strategy to precinct delivery. One substrate underneath all of it.">
<meta property="og:type" content="website">
<meta property="og:url" content="https://www.circularecosystems.io/services">
<meta property="og:site_name" content="Circular Ecosystems">

<!-- Fonts -->
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.googleapis.com">
<link rel="preconnect" href="https://fonts.gstatic.com" crossorigin>
<link href="https://fonts.googleapis.com/css2?family=DM+Sans:opsz,wght@9..40,400;9..40,500;9..40,700&family=DM+Mono:wght@400;500&family=Cormorant+Garamond:ital,wght@0,500;1,500&display=swap" rel="stylesheet">

<style is:inline>
/* ===========================================================
   CIRCULAR ECOSYSTEMS — SERVICES PAGE
   Design tokens inherited verbatim from the master site.
   =========================================================== */
:root{
  --ink:#050C0F;
  --ink-2:#0A171C;
  --ink-3:#0F2A33;
  --forest:#004A5A;
  --teal:#2C7881;
  --mint:#C7F9D0;
  --cream:#F6F2EA;
  --paper:#F5F0E8;
  --fg:#EAF2F0;
  --fg-dim:#9FB4B2;
  --fg-faint:#B8BFBE;
  --line:rgba(199,249,208,0.12);
  --maxw:1240px;
  --ease:cubic-bezier(.22,.61,.36,1);
}
*{margin:0;padding:0;box-sizing:border-box}
html{scroll-behavior:smooth;-webkit-text-size-adjust:100%;scroll-padding-top:90px}
body{
  background:var(--ink);
  color:var(--fg);
  font-family:"DM Sans",-apple-system,BlinkMacSystemFont,"Segoe UI",sans-serif;
  font-size:17px;line-height:1.6;font-weight:400;
  -webkit-font-smoothing:antialiased;
  overflow-x:hidden;
}
::selection{background:var(--mint);color:var(--ink)}
a{color:inherit;text-decoration:none}
img{display:block;max-width:100%}
.wrap{max-width:var(--maxw);margin:0 auto;padding:0 40px}
.mono{font-family:"DM Mono",ui-monospace,monospace}
.kicker{
  font-family:"DM Mono",ui-monospace,monospace;
  font-size:12px;letter-spacing:.22em;text-transform:uppercase;
  color:var(--teal);display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;
}
.kicker::before{content:"";width:28px;height:1px;background:var(--teal);display:inline-block}
h1,h2,h3{font-weight:700;line-height:1.04;letter-spacing:-.02em;color:#F4F8F6}
.display{
  font-size:clamp(2.3rem,5.2vw,4.4rem);
  font-weight:700;letter-spacing:-.035em;line-height:1.0;
  text-shadow:0 2px 28px rgba(5,12,15,.55), 0 1px 4px rgba(5,12,15,.7);
}
.display em{font-family:"Cormorant Garamond",Georgia,serif;font-style:italic;font-weight:500;color:var(--mint);letter-spacing:0}
.h2{font-size:clamp(2rem,4.4vw,3.4rem);letter-spacing:-.03em;line-height:1.02}
.lead{font-size:clamp(1.05rem,1.7vw,1.32rem);line-height:1.55;color:var(--fg-dim);font-weight:400;max-width:46ch}

/* ---------- NAV ---------- */
nav{
  position:fixed;top:0;left:0;right:0;z-index:100;
  display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;
  padding:22px 40px;transition:all .5s var(--ease);
  border-bottom:1px solid transparent;
}
nav.solid{
  background:rgba(5,12,15,.72);backdrop-filter:blur(14px);
  -webkit-backdrop-filter:blur(14px);padding:14px 40px;
  border-bottom:1px solid var(--line);
}
.brand{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:12px;font-weight:500;letter-spacing:.02em}
.navlinks{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:30px}
.navlinks a{font-size:13px;color:var(--fg-dim);transition:color .3s;letter-spacing:.01em}
.navlinks a:hover{color:var(--mint)}
.navlinks a[aria-current="page"]{color:var(--mint)}
.btn{
  font-family:"DM Mono",monospace;font-size:13px;letter-spacing:.04em;
  padding:12px 22px;border:1px solid var(--teal);border-radius:2px;
  color:var(--mint);background:transparent;cursor:pointer;
  transition:all .35s var(--ease);position:relative;overflow:hidden;display:inline-block;
  z-index:1;
}
.btn::after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:var(--mint);transform:translateY(101%);transition:transform .4s var(--ease);z-index:-1}
.btn:hover, .btn2:hover{color:var(--ink) !important;border-color:var(--mint)}
.btn:hover::after, .btn2:hover::after{transform:translateY(0)}
.btn-solid{background:var(--mint);color:var(--ink);border-color:var(--mint);font-weight:500}
.btn-solid::after{background:#a6e7b6}
.btn-solid:hover{color:var(--ink) !important}
.logo{height:25px;width:auto;display:block}
nav.solid .logo{height:24px}
footer .footbrand .logo{height:30px;margin-bottom:18px}

/* ---------- PAGE HERO ---------- */
header{position:relative;min-height:90vh;display:flex;align-items:center;overflow:hidden}
.hero-bg{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:0}
.hero-bg img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;transform:scale(1.06);animation:slowzoom 22s var(--ease) forwards;filter:saturate(.85) contrast(1.05)}
@keyframes slowzoom{to{transform:scale(1)}}
.hero-bg::after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;
  background:
    radial-gradient(120% 90% at 70% 30%, rgba(0,74,90,.30), transparent 60%),
    linear-gradient(180deg, rgba(5,12,15,.76) 0%, rgba(5,12,15,.66) 38%, rgba(5,12,15,.94) 86%, var(--ink) 100%);
}
.hero-bg::before{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:1;
  background:linear-gradient(90deg, rgba(5,12,15,.88) 0%, rgba(5,12,15,.38) 52%, transparent 100%);}
#net{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:2;opacity:.5;pointer-events:none}
.hero-inner{position:relative;z-index:5;width:100%}
.hero-inner .wrap{padding-top:132px;padding-bottom:60px}
.eyebrow-row{overflow:hidden;margin-bottom:28px}
.hero h1{margin:0 0 30px;max-width:19ch}
.hero .lead{margin-bottom:36px;max-width:60ch}
.hero-cta{display:flex;align-items:center;gap:20px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.fade-up{opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px);animation:fadeup .9s var(--ease) forwards}
.d1{animation-delay:.12s}.d2{animation-delay:.26s}.d3{animation-delay:.4s}.d4{animation-delay:.54s}
@keyframes fadeup{to{opacity:1;transform:translateY(0)}}
.hero-meta{margin-top:46px;padding-top:22px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);max-width:80ch}
.hero-meta .mono{font-size:12px;color:var(--fg-faint);letter-spacing:.12em}

/* ---------- SECTIONS ---------- */
section{position:relative;padding:130px 0}
.sec-head{max-width:62ch;margin-bottom:56px}
.sec-head h2{margin-top:22px}
.reveal{opacity:0;transform:translateY(28px);transition:opacity 1s var(--ease),transform 1s var(--ease)}
.reveal.in{opacity:1;transform:none}
.reveal.d1{transition-delay:.08s}.reveal.d2{transition-delay:.16s}.reveal.d3{transition-delay:.24s}

/* ---------- SERVICE INDEX ---------- */
.services{background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--ink),var(--ink-2))}
.svc-jump{display:flex;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:10px;margin:0 0 54px}
.jchip{font-family:"DM Mono",monospace;font-size:11.5px;letter-spacing:.06em;color:var(--fg-dim);
  border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:2px;padding:9px 14px;background:transparent;cursor:pointer;
  transition:border-color .35s,color .35s,background .35s;text-transform:uppercase}
.jchip:hover,.jchip.on{border-color:var(--teal);color:var(--mint);background:rgba(199,249,208,.05)}
.svc-list{border-top:1px solid var(--line)}
.svc-item{border-bottom:1px solid var(--line)}
.svc-head{display:flex;align-items:flex-start;gap:26px;padding:34px 4px;cursor:pointer;user-select:none;width:100%;background:none;border:0;text-align:left;font-family:inherit;color:inherit}
.svc-head .n{font-family:"DM Mono",monospace;font-size:13px;color:var(--teal);letter-spacing:.06em;min-width:30px;padding-top:9px}
.svc-headings{flex:1}
.svc-cat{display:block;font-family:"DM Mono",monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--fg-faint);margin-bottom:12px;transition:color .35s}
.svc-head h3{font-size:clamp(1.2rem,2.1vw,1.62rem);letter-spacing:-.02em;font-weight:700;color:#F4F8F6;transition:color .35s;line-height:1.22;max-width:34ch}
.svc-head h3 em{font-family:"Cormorant Garamond",Georgia,serif;font-style:italic;font-weight:500;color:var(--teal);letter-spacing:0;font-size:1.14em;transition:color .35s}
.svc-item:hover .svc-head h3,.svc-item.open .svc-head h3{color:var(--mint)}
.svc-item:hover .svc-head h3 em,.svc-item.open .svc-head h3 em{color:var(--mint)}
.svc-item.open .svc-cat{color:var(--teal)}
.svc-head .ic{position:relative;width:16px;height:16px;flex-shrink:0;margin-top:12px}
.svc-head .ic::before,.svc-head .ic::after{content:"";position:absolute;background:var(--teal);transition:transform .4s var(--ease),background .35s}
.svc-head .ic::before{top:7px;left:0;width:16px;height:2px}
.svc-head .ic::after{left:7px;top:0;width:2px;height:16px}
.svc-item.open .svc-head .ic::after{transform:scaleY(0)}
.svc-item.open .svc-head .ic::before{background:var(--mint)}
.svc-body{max-height:0;overflow:hidden;opacity:0;transition:max-height .6s var(--ease),opacity .5s var(--ease)}
.svc-item.open .svc-body{opacity:1}
.svc-inner{padding:6px 0 46px 56px}
.svc-who{font-size:1.02rem;line-height:1.55;color:var(--fg-dim);max-width:70ch;padding:20px 24px;border-left:2px solid var(--teal);background:rgba(44,120,129,.08);border-radius:0 2px 2px 0;margin-bottom:38px}
.svc-who b{color:#F4F8F6;font-weight:500;font-family:"DM Mono",monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;text-transform:uppercase;display:block;margin-bottom:8px;color:var(--mint)}
.svc-cols{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(3,1fr);gap:1px;background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line)}
.svc-col{background:var(--ink-2);padding:34px 30px 36px}
.svc-col h4{font-family:"DM Mono",monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.16em;text-transform:uppercase;color:var(--teal);font-weight:400;margin-bottom:22px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:10px}
.svc-col h4::after{content:"";flex:1;height:1px;background:var(--line)}
.svc-col.pay h4{color:var(--mint)}
.svc-col ul{list-style:none;display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:16px}
.svc-col li{position:relative;padding-left:20px;color:var(--fg-dim);font-size:.97rem;line-height:1.52}
.svc-col li::before{content:"";position:absolute;left:0;top:10px;width:6px;height:1px;background:var(--teal)}
.svc-col.pay li{color:#DCEAE6}
.svc-col.pay li::before{background:var(--mint)}
.svc-foot{display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:space-between;gap:24px;flex-wrap:wrap;margin-top:26px}
.svc-book{font-family:"DM Mono",monospace;font-size:13px;color:var(--mint);display:inline-flex;align-items:center;gap:8px;transition:gap .3s;cursor:pointer;background:none;border:0}
.svc-book:hover{gap:16px}
.svc-ref{font-family:"DM Mono",monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--fg-faint);text-transform:uppercase}

/* ---------- ROLES ---------- */
.roles{background:var(--ink-2)}
.role-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:1px;background:var(--line);border:1px solid var(--line);margin-top:8px}
.role{background:var(--ink-2);padding:42px 40px;transition:background .5s var(--ease);position:relative}
.role:hover{background:#0c1f25}
.role .rtag{font-family:"DM Mono",monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--teal);text-transform:uppercase}
.role h3{font-size:1.18rem;line-height:1.32;margin:20px 0 14px;letter-spacing:-.01em;max-width:32ch}
.role p{color:var(--fg-dim);font-size:.98rem;line-height:1.55;max-width:44ch}
.role .mark{position:absolute;top:44px;right:40px;width:7px;height:7px;border-radius:50%;background:var(--line);transition:all .5s var(--ease)}
.role:hover .mark{background:var(--mint);box-shadow:0 0 14px var(--mint)}

/* ---------- PROCUREMENT (inverted) ---------- */
.proc{background:var(--cream);color:var(--ink-3)}
.proc .kicker{color:var(--forest)}
.proc .kicker::before{background:var(--forest)}
.proc h2{color:var(--forest);font-size:clamp(2rem,4.4vw,3.3rem);margin:26px 0 20px;letter-spacing:-.03em;line-height:1.04;max-width:20ch}
.proc .plead{font-size:clamp(1.05rem,1.7vw,1.28rem);line-height:1.6;color:#243b40;max-width:56ch}
.proc-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:repeat(2,1fr);gap:1px;background:rgba(0,74,90,.16);border:1px solid rgba(0,74,90,.16);margin-top:60px}
.proc-cell{background:var(--cream);padding:40px 38px}
.proc-cell .pn{font-family:"DM Mono",monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.14em;color:var(--teal);text-transform:uppercase}
.proc-cell p{margin-top:18px;color:#243b40;font-size:1.02rem;line-height:1.58;max-width:44ch}
.proc-cta{margin-top:54px;display:flex;align-items:center;gap:22px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.proc .btn{border-color:var(--forest);color:var(--forest)}
.proc .btn::after{background:var(--forest)}
.proc .btn:hover{color:var(--cream);border-color:var(--forest)}
.proc-note{font-family:"DM Mono",monospace;font-size:12.5px;color:#4a6168;letter-spacing:.02em;max-width:46ch;line-height:1.7}

/* ---------- CTA ---------- */
.cta{position:relative;background:var(--ink);overflow:hidden;padding:150px 0}
.cta-bg{position:absolute;inset:0;z-index:0}
.cta-bg img{width:100%;height:100%;object-fit:cover;filter:saturate(.7) brightness(.5)}
.cta-bg::after{content:"";position:absolute;inset:0;background:linear-gradient(180deg,var(--ink),rgba(5,12,15,.78) 40%,var(--ink))}
.cta .wrap{position:relative;z-index:3}
.cta-grid{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:80px;align-items:start}
.cta h2{font-size:clamp(2.2rem,5vw,4rem);letter-spacing:-.035em;line-height:1.0}
.cta .lead{margin-top:28px;max-width:40ch}
.cta .contact-line{margin-top:40px;font-family:"DM Mono",monospace;font-size:13px;color:var(--fg-dim);letter-spacing:.04em;line-height:2}
.cta .contact-line a{color:var(--mint)}
form{display:flex;flex-direction:column;gap:18px}
.field label{display:block;font-family:"DM Mono",monospace;font-size:11px;letter-spacing:.1em;color:var(--fg-faint);text-transform:uppercase;margin-bottom:8px}
.field input,.field textarea{
  width:100%;background:rgba(255,255,255,.03);border:1px solid var(--line);
  border-radius:2px;padding:14px 16px;color:var(--fg);font-family:"DM Sans",sans-serif;
  font-size:15px;transition:border-color .3s,background .3s;
}
.field input:focus,.field textarea:focus{outline:none;border-color:var(--teal);background:rgba(199,249,208,.04)}
.field textarea{resize:vertical;min-height:96px}
.formrow{display:grid;grid-template-columns:1fr 1fr;gap:18px}

/* ---------- FORM STATES ---------- */
.hidden{display:none !important}
.form-error{
  background-color:#a82e2e;border:1px solid rgba(226,30,30,0.4);
  color:#ffffff;padding:14px 18px;border-radius:2px;font-size:0.875rem;
}
.form-success{
  text-align:center;padding:40px 20px;
  background:rgba(199,249,208,0.05);border:1px solid var(--line);border-radius:2px;
}
.success-icon{
  width:52px;height:52px;background:var(--mint);color:var(--ink);
  border-radius:50%;display:flex;align-items:center;justify-content:center;
  font-size:1.4rem;margin:0 auto 16px;font-weight:bold;
}
.form-success h3{color:var(--mint);font-size:1.25rem;margin:0 0 8px}
.form-success p{color:var(--fg-dim);font-size:0.95rem;margin:0}

/* ---------- FOOTER ---------- */
footer{background:var(--ink);border-top:1px solid var(--line);padding:70px 0 50px}
.footgrid{display:flex;justify-content:space-between;align-items:flex-start;gap:40px;flex-wrap:wrap}
.footbrand{max-width:340px}
.footbrand .brand{margin-bottom:18px}
.footbrand p{color:var(--fg-faint);font-size:14px;line-height:1.6}
.footmeta{font-family:"DM Mono",monospace;font-size:12px;color:var(--fg-faint);letter-spacing:.06em;text-align:right;line-height:2}
.footmeta a:hover{color:var(--mint)}
.footbottom{margin-top:54px;padding-top:26px;border-top:1px solid var(--line);display:flex;justify-content:space-between;flex-wrap:wrap;gap:14px;font-family:"DM Mono",monospace;font-size:11px;color:var(--fg-faint);letter-spacing:.06em}

/* ---------- RESPONSIVE ---------- */
@media(max-width:1240px){
  .navlinks{gap:22px}
  .navlinks a{font-size:12.5px}
  .btn{padding:11px 18px;font-size:12.5px}
}
@media(max-width:1080px){
  .svc-cols{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  .svc-col{padding:30px 28px 32px}
}
@media(max-width:980px){
  .wrap{padding:0 24px}
  nav{padding:18px 24px}
  .navlinks{display:none}
  .cta-grid,.formrow{grid-template-columns:1fr;gap:48px}
  .role-grid,.proc-grid{grid-template-columns:1fr}
  section{padding:90px 0}
  .hero-inner .wrap{padding-top:130px}
  .svc-inner{padding-left:0}
  .svc-head{gap:18px}
}
@media(max-width:560px){
  .svc-head .n{min-width:24px;font-size:12px}
  .role{padding:34px 28px}
}
</style>
</head>
<body>

<nav id="nav">
  <a class="brand" href="/" aria-label="Circular Ecosystems - home"><img class="logo" src="/logoofCE.png" alt="Circular Ecosystems"></a>
  <div class="navlinks">
    <a href="/#problem">The problem</a>
    <a href="/#outcomes">What changes</a>
    <a href="/services" aria-current="page">Services</a>
    <a href="/#platform">Intelligence Arc</a>
    <a href="/#insights">Insights</a>
    <a href="/sequence" target="_blank">The Sequence Model</a>
    <a href="#contact" class="btn">Start a conversation</a>
  </div>
</nav>

<!-- ============ PAGE HERO ============ -->
<header id="top" class="hero">
  <div class="hero-bg"><img src={heroImage.src} alt="Industrial precinct at dusk"></div>
  <canvas id="net"></canvas>
  <div class="hero-inner">
    <div class="wrap">
      <div class="eyebrow-row"><span class="kicker fade-up">Services &middot; Strategic industrial circularity</span></div>
      <h1 class="display fade-up d1">From regional strategy to precinct delivery. One <em>substrate</em> underneath all of it.</h1>
      <p class="lead fade-up d2">The market calls this work net zero industrial precincts, eco-industrial precincts, industrial symbiosis, circular economy hubs. Underneath the labels it is a set of upstream decisions about governance, geometry, tenant mix, and capital sequence that determine whether a regional industrial system compounds or strands. Each service below is a bounded engagement: a defined question, a fixed price, a deliverable that survives scrutiny after we leave the room.</p>
      <div class="hero-cta fade-up d3">
        <a href="#services" class="btn btn-solid">See the eight services</a>
        <a href="#contact" class="btn btn2">Book a briefing</a>
      </div>
      <div class="hero-meta fade-up d4">
        <span class="mono">Eight bounded engagements &middot; Fixed lump sum &middot; Government procurement ready</span>
      </div>
    </div>
  </div>
</header>

<!-- ============ SERVICE INDEX ============ -->
<section class="services" id="services">
  <div class="wrap">
    <div class="sec-head">
      <span class="kicker reveal">The engagements</span>
      <h2 class="h2 reveal d1">Eight ways in. The same substrate underneath every one.</h2>
      <p class="lead reveal d2" style="margin-top:22px;max-width:58ch">Open the engagement that matches the decision in front of you. Each one names the problem it answers, the work it covers, and what you hold at the end of it.</p>
    </div>

    <div class="svc-jump reveal d2" id="jump"></div>

    <div class="svc-list reveal d2" id="svcList">

      <!-- 01 -->
      <div class="svc-item" id="s01" data-svc="01">
        <button class="svc-head" aria-expanded="false">
          <span class="n">01</span>
          <span class="svc-headings">
            <span class="svc-cat">Regional circularity strategy</span>
            <h3>A regional circular economy strategy that <em>treasury</em> can fund.</h3>
          </span>
          <span class="ic"></span>
        </button>
        <div class="svc-body"><div class="svc-inner">
          <p class="svc-who"><b>Who it is for</b>State agencies, regional development commissions, and corridor authorities carrying a regional industrial transition mandate.</p>
          <div class="svc-cols">
            <div class="svc-col"><h4>The problem</h4><ul>
              <li>Your region has been named in a strategy: a hydrogen hub, a critical minerals corridor, a renewable energy industrial precinct.</li>
              <li>The announcements arrive as project portfolios; the question they raise is a system one.</li>
              <li>Nobody holds the answers to what the region's water, energy, land, and logistics can actually carry.</li>
              <li>The current geometry is quietly foreclosing exchanges nobody has mapped.</li>
            </ul></div>
            <div class="svc-col"><h4>What we do</h4><ul>
              <li>Resource flow inventories across the operator base, with verified mass and energy balances.</li>
